<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "togisuma.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\背景\葬儀1.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>―She's only just started high school, hasn't she?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―It's really such a shame.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―Being chief mourner for her own parent at that age, the poor thing.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, here, I bought you some tea."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yeah, thanks."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"What's wrong?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"N-no, it's nothing..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Okay..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
―But <STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu-chan</STYLE> is so brave, really.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―Receiving the mourners that properly.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―Even I couldn't do it...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hm?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Are you okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yeah, I'm fine. Because </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s here with me."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"If </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> weren't here, I'd..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
―Who's that with her?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―Her friend <STYLE ID="1">Akane-chan</STYLE>, they say. Apparently she's always with <STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu-chan</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―I see, she has a good friend, then.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Sorry, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, I'm going outside for a bit..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\アスファルトダッシュ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\背景\葬儀2.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "1000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Uuu... nnngh...! Dad...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Uuu... </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">... Dad died..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I know, but </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, you did so well. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I'm sure your dad can rest easy, too."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hey..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hm?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Do you believe in past lives?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Past lives?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Maybe I was a bad person..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"My mom died right after I was born, and Dad was still young, too..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"That's not true. If you're having it hard now, then surely in the future―"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"I wonder if that's really true... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Will I be done losing family now...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Say I get married and have a kid. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Can I really say death won't part us...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Well, partings come sooner or later."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"But parting this early, I hate it..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, it's okay. I'll always be by your side, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"You can't."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, you'll get married someday too and have a family of your own."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"But thanks. Even if it's just for now, I'm happy you're with me."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Ehe, if I cry this much, I'll be a bother to the people around us, huh. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">I won't cry anymore!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Don't go to such extremes. It's okay to cry in front of everyone."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"No, I can't embarrass Dad."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"All right. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But don't push yourself. You can lean on me anytime, okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yeah, thank you. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, thank you."</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
